            <li><strong>W3C Trace Context</strong> propagation for end-to-end trace continuity across event pipelines.</li>
            <li><strong>JMX → OTel</strong> for broker metrics; client-side instrumentation for producer/consumer traces.</li>
            <li><strong>KIP-714 / KIP-1076</strong> enable brokers to collect client metrics directly — eliminating per-client exporters.</li>
            <li><strong>KRaft-specific metrics:</strong> Monitor controller quorum state, metadata commit lag, and controller election events.</li>
